{"id":1211,"date":"2021-03-15T14:36:40","date_gmt":"2021-03-15T14:36:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=1211"},"modified":"2021-03-15T18:37:44","modified_gmt":"2021-03-15T18:37:44","slug":"rdrc-interise-queens-amplified-women-of-the-month","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/rdrc-interise-queens-amplified-women-of-the-month\/","title":{"rendered":"Business Spotlight: Women&#8217;s History Month 2021"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">RDRC\/Interise Amplified Queens Streetwise MBA Program<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">The Rockaway Development &amp; Revitalization Corporation&#8217;s Amplified Queens StreetWise MBA Program, powered by Interise, initiative fulfils the CBO&#8217;s commitment to advance the economic growth of Queens-based small businesses and professionals. The Amplify Queens StreetWise MBA Program, a seven-month program with the financial support of Santander Bank, uses a peer-learning method to provide small business owners with the knowledge and networks necessary to grow and scale. Industry experts, business peers, and the program&#8217;s instructor provide insights, strategies, motivation.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">To commemorate Women&#8217;s History Month, we introduce three women-owned businesses, who identified with the program&#8217;s methodologies to support, help grow, sustain their businesses, empower the family economic growth in their communities during challenges times, creating their Legacy. Dawn Kelly, owner of\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/the-nourish-spot.business.site\/\">&#8220;The Nourish Spot,&#8221;<\/a><\/span>\u00a0Grant Winner, \u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.prnewswire.com\/news-releases\/anastasia-beverly-hills-awards-nearly-half-of-a-million-dollars-in-grants-to-eight-black-female-owned-small-businesses-301236517.html\">The Anastasia Beverly Hills Grant Initiative<\/a><\/span>, Kisha Ulysse,\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/closewithkish\/?hl=en\">Real Licensed Realtor<\/a><\/span>, owner of\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/childcarecenter.us\/provider_detail\/brilliant_minds_group_family_day_care_llc_far_rockaway_ny\">Brilliant Minds Group Family Daycare, LLC<\/a><\/span>, and Sylvia Cothia, owner of\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jetwayhvac.com\/\">Jetway Heating Cooling &amp; Refrigeration<\/a><\/span>,\u00a0and, President of\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/positivewomenunited.org\/\">&#8220;Positive Women United&#8221;<\/a><\/span>.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">\u00a0Meet The Amplified Queens StreetWise MBA Women!<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Dawn Kelly: Founder &amp; CEO, <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/the-nourish-spot.business.site\/\">The Nourish Spot<\/a><\/span>, Grant Winner, <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.prnewswire.com\/news-releases\/anastasia-beverly-hills-awards-nearly-half-of-a-million-dollars-in-grants-to-eight-black-female-owned-small-businesses-301236517.html\">Anastasia Beverly Hills Grant Initiative<\/a><\/span>. Say hello to Dawn at <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/thenourishspot\/\">@thenourishspot<\/a><span style=\"color: #000080;\">, she would love to hear from you<\/span><\/span><\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/10JcaqZJ07UjW3qxQXrp5abLZn7WxjPGd\/view?usp=sharing\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1214\" style=\"caret-color: #000080; color: #000080;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Photo1-Headshot-The-Nourish-Spot-Dawn.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"273\" height=\"183\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Photo1-Headshot-The-Nourish-Spot-Dawn.jpg 640w, https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Photo1-Headshot-The-Nourish-Spot-Dawn-300x201.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 273px) 100vw, 273px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\"> <span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Lady Persevere<\/span>: &#8220;Who would have thought, a beauty brand would connect with a quick-service healthy establishment?&#8221; says Dawn Kelly, but, I am persistent, in spite of opposition&#8221;. <\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Kisha Ulysse: Founder &amp; CEO,<\/span> <a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/childcarecenter.us\/provider_detail\/brilliant_minds_group_family_day_care_llc_far_rockaway_ny\">Brilliant Minds Group Family Daycare, LLC<\/a>, and <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/closewithkish\/?hl=en\">Real Licensed Realtor<\/a><\/span> <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/closewithkish\/?hl=en\">@closewithkish<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/closewithkish\/?hl=en\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1215\" style=\"caret-color: #000080; color: #000080;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Photo5-Headshot-Kisha.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"286\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Photo5-Headshot-Kisha.jpg 1164w, https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Photo5-Headshot-Kisha-273x300.jpg 273w, https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Photo5-Headshot-Kisha-768x845.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Photo5-Headshot-Kisha-931x1024.jpg 931w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 260px) 100vw, 260px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Lady of Honor<\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\">: As a Licensed Realtor, &#8220;I take pride in my work, and am honored to have the opportunity to help families just like yours&#8221;. as the CEO of BrilliantMinds, &#8220;I am to fuel our children, our future leaders with intellect&#8221; says Kisha Ulysse.<\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Silvia Cothia: Founder &amp; CEO, <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jetwayhvac.com\/\">Jetway Heating Cooling And Refrigeration<\/a><\/span>, Founder &amp; Prez. <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/positivewomenunited.org\/\">Positive Women United<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Lady of Values:<\/span> &#8220;<span style=\"color: #000080;\">Being a minority business woman can be challenging when dealing with customers. At<\/span> <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jetwayhvac.com\/\">JetWay<\/a><\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\">, I encourage core-value customer service, you are a representation of your brand, and being mission driven to superb customer service is a major priority&#8221;. states Sylvia<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Lady of Purpose: <a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/positivewomenunited.org\/\">&#8220;<\/a><\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Positive Women United<\/span> was designed from a deep need to give back to young girls of all ages, connect with, communicate on a deeper level, and empower the future generation of women&#8221;. says Sylvia<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.jetwayhvac.com\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1219\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Photo-Headshot-UPDATE-Sylvia-Cothia.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"269\" height=\"275\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Ladies, we at RDRC and Interise celebrate you, the women you are, and the great values you are implementing in your communities!<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">To learn more about each of our Amplified Queens StreetWise MBA Women, visit their digital platforms. Please get to know them, dine healthy with <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/10JcaqZJ07UjW3qxQXrp5abLZn7WxjPGd\/view?usp=sharing\">Dawn Kelly<\/a><\/span>, allow <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/closewithkish\/?hl=en\">Kish Ulysse<\/a><\/span> assist you in purchasing your dream home, and connect with <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/positivewomenunited.org\/\">Sylvia Cothia<\/a><\/span>, to be encouraged, strengthened and empowered, as you grow into your woman-hood.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>RDRC\/Interise Amplified Queens Streetwise MBA Program The Rockaway Development &amp; Revitalization Corporation&#8217;s Amplified Queens StreetWise MBA Program, powered by Interise, initiative fulfils the CBO&#8217;s commitment to advance the economic growth of Queens-based small businesses and professionals. The Amplify Queens StreetWise MBA Program, a seven-month program with the financial support of Santander Bank, uses a peer-learning [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1216,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-1211","rdrcnews","type-rdrcn